    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure with Pinchi-Stingi, a deceptively simple yet challenging tile puzzle game! Channel your inner strategist with chess-like planning and adaptive problem-solving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate tiles to guide our endearing Crabs to their Starfish companions, while dodging the perilous Jellies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills further by changing the board size for increased difficulty. Dive into Pinchi-Stingi and let the puzzle-solving fun begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427710/extras/9393c4d2d08f45bb37cbfebbdb040165.poster.avif?t=1739813886\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427710/extras/9393c4d2d08f45bb37cbfebbdb040165.webm?t=1739813886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427710/extras/9393c4d2d08f45bb37cbfebbdb040165.mp4?t=1739813886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427710/extras/a3d988ac77c956be3c2c1209c788d0d9.avif?t=1739813886\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure with Pinchi-Stingi, a deceptively simple yet challenging tile puzzle game! Channel your inner strategist with chess-like planning and adaptive problem-solving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate tiles to guide our endearing Crabs to their Starfish companions, while dodging the perilous Jellies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills further by changing the board size for increased difficulty. Dive into Pinchi-Stingi and let the puzzle-solving fun begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427710/extras/9393c4d2d08f45bb37cbfebbdb040165.poster.avif?t=1739813886\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427710/extras/9393c4d2d08f45bb37cbfebbdb040165.webm?t=1739813886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427710/extras/9393c4d2d08f45bb37cbfebbdb040165.mp4?t=1739813886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427710/extras/a3d988ac77c956be3c2c1209c788d0d9.avif?t=1739813886\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p>",
